Two modules. Do not mix them.

  datapath/          hotel-only, optional
    DATAPATH=ecmp10  21-MAC harvest, sticky ct, idle-biased slots
                     score = EWMA of nft iif→LAN bytes (hotel download)
                     healthy legs probed every PROBE_OK_SEC (default 180s)
    DATAPATH=plain   single default route, no identity marks
    seam: hotel_datapath_apply | hotel_datapath_egress
    unplug: set DATAPATH=plain

  stack              always on
    hotel-dns.sh     SmartDNS: cn list → Ali DoH; default → mihomo
    hotel-split.sh   nft @direct4 (cnip) + leak hijack; remainder tproxy
    hotel-proxy.sh   mihomo Claude/CF rules supplement PROXY, then MATCH,PROXY — no extra groups

Packet path (LAN → WAN)

  1. nat/prerouting dns_hijack
       UDP/TCP 53,853 → local dnsmasq → 127.0.0.1:6053
  2. filter/prerouting -100  hotel_split.tproxy_pre
       skip pkttype broadcast/multicast, fib local/broadcast/multicast,
       UDP 67/68, 169.254/16, RFC1918, 255.255.255.255, @direct4, @node4
       Anthropic 160.79.104.0/21, @claude4 (SmartDNS nftset), and UDP/123
       tproxy first so Cloudflare-CN / CN NTP cannot bypass the proxy.
       UDP/443 is rejected (not dropped) so Chrome HTTP/3 falls back to TCP
       immediately. 1.1.1.1/1.0.0.1 TCP/443 is always tproxied (CF trace).
       leftover public unicast → tproxy (SPLIT_REMAINDER=proxy)
       DHCP DISCOVER is broadcast; omitting it from skip steals Wi-Fi IP.
  3. filter/prerouting -95   datapath (ecmp10 only)
       meta mark 16384 return (already tproxied)
       else sticky ct → identity mark 1..21
  4. mihomo: Claude/Anthropic/Cloudflare rules are extra PROXY matches,
     then MATCH,PROXY. One AUTO url-test over all nodes (家宽 included).
     UDP/443 (HTTP/3) is dropped so browsers fall back to TCP.

System (experience, not datapath)

  SmartDNS is the packaged ubus name "smartdns" so Luci shows 运行中.
  Bind stays 127.0.0.1:6053. dnsmasq listens on lan only (not hotel WAN IPs).
  Router resolver is 127.0.0.1. FullCone on, flow offload off (keeps fwmark).
  Extra 5G hotel STAs disabled so Redmi-5G can leave hotel ch161.
  2.4G AP on. 2.4G hotel STA is copper-cut backup only: disabled while
  wan carrier is up (shared mt76 firmware hangs when AP+STA run together).
  Hotplug wan add/remove calls hotel-guard.sh sta. No BBR kmod.
  Hotel last measured 2026-09-20 from the router, CN direct (Tsinghua):
    one identity ~5–9 Mbps; six identities in parallel ~33 Mbps.
    Copper is 100 Full; the hotel path is far below that. Retired
    figures: ~10 Mbps/MAC and ~60 Mbps/room. speedtest.cn 石家庄
    (~2 Mbps, ~1–2 s loaded RTT) is not this pipe — do not tune
    harvest or SQM against that node.
  WAN SQM: 10/100 PHY → HTB+fq_codel on wan egress (LAN upload) at WAN_SQM_PCT.
  No nft download police (it collapses TCP). No ifb/act_police on this image.
  Gigabit → fq_codel only. SQM is stamped; wan hotplug re-applies if boot
  raced the PHY; observe also reapplies HTB if 10/100 wan has noqueue.
  hotelctl doctor is fail-closed: ok=0 unless DHCP listen, AP forwarding,
  tproxy pkttype skip, WAN SQM, harvest-independent Wi-Fi, m2u off,
  secret 600, and SSH/HTTP not on 0.0.0.0. Observe every minute runs
  hotel-guard (AP recover after 180s boot grace + 2 strikes; proxy/DNS/SQM
  heal; STA role) then writes /tmp/hotel/doctor.json. rgb:status is harvest;
  rgb:network is AP+stack (red means Wi-Fi dead even if harvest is green).
  MAPUPD is an atomic slot-map swap; it must not delete tproxy_pre or
  dns_hijack. Boot stack is S99hotel-multidial then S99hotel-proxy.
  rc.local is a pidof safety net only; it must not rebuild SQM or DNS
  when those processes are already up. hotel.pre skip list has no FakeIP
  range (redir-host). Canary probes AUTO first; other tags only if AUTO
  is down, so a live backup node does not fail-open.
  ICMP to the hotel gw is rate-limited — do not tune against ping loss.
  Watch/IoT belongs on Redmi-2.4G.
  score_legs: one nft dump + one awk; acct./ewma./raw. files unchanged.

DNS

  CN: DustinWin cn.list → Ali DoH (223.5.5.5 and 223.6.6.6). .cn TLD also
      uses that group. No UDP/53 backup: hotel may intercept outbound 53.
      Default DNS is 127.0.0.1:5553 (Cloudflare via PROXY) so 漏网之鱼
      resolve the same way they are forwarded.
      Claude domain-set is applied after cn-list so Anthropic/Claude/CDN
      never take Ali DoH even if a name appears on the CN list.
  Proxy DNS fail-open: if mihomo is down, both Ali DoH become the default.
  Ads: usr/share/hotel/ad-domains.gz  (秋风 AWAvenue 1.7.6, domain-set SOA)
  CN CIDR: etc/hotel/direct4.nft from DustinWin cnip.list; never tproxy

Why this split is fast

  nft set lookup O(1) on cnip. mihomo never sees CN packets. Non-CN DNS
  goes through 5553; leftover public IPs tproxy. First packet of a CN
  domain: Ali DoH + tcp-syn. TYPE65 SOA so the client uses A immediately.
